# What crates/suru-relay/Dockerfile is given of the repository it is built from, in place of its root .dockerignore:
# only what Cargo reads to build `suru-relay` from the workspace, which takes every member's manifest and sources.
*
!.cargo/config.toml
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!crates/
!src/
!migrations/
crates/*/target
